  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Billy Greeting**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances [4]\n- **Crossing Muddy Waters**: rare: 9 archived performances [4]\n- **Ten Degrees And Getting Colder**: back after 101 archived shows (793 days); rare: 7 archived performances [4]\n- **Ruben's Train**: back after 66 archived shows (475 days); rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **Me And My Uncle**: back after 222 archived shows (1434 days) [4]\n- **Cassidy**: back after 244 archived shows (1547 days); rare: 7 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2026-02-06** (recommended): source not stated; 23 songs; 156 min; rated 2.5/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Taper positioned at the back of Section E, just in front of the front-of-house mixing position, with mics about eight and a half feet high [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2026-02-06**: taped by Z-Man; transferred by Z-Man; source: Schoeps CCM4V'S>Sound Devices Mix-Pre 6 II (48/32) [1]. Also: Recorded and seeded by Z-Man using Schoeps CCM4V microphones into a Sound Devices Mix-Pre 6 II at 48kHz/32-bit; Processed via Sound Forge 18.0 and CD Wave, converted to 16-bit FLAC, and tagged in Foobar 2000; labeled Team Dirty South and Home Team Recording [1]",
